note colors holds band color names joined by commas. value is the two-digit number given by the
note first two bands (black 0, brown 1, red 2, orange 3, yellow 4, green 5, blue 6, violet 7, grey 8,
note white 9); further bands are ignored.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/resistor-color-duo
om2
fn value colors view uchar * to ulong
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
